  m_text: If you are new to DMOG, it is strongly recommended that you complete the
    interactive tutorial before joining a live scenario. The tutorial walks you through
    the core interface panels, demonstrates how to select and deploy role-specific
    assets onto the operational map, and shows how to respond to common incident
    types. Completing it will ensure you understand the essential controls and decision-making
    workflow so you can contribute effectively during multiplayer training exercises.
